<given-names>B.R.</given-names></name><name><surname>Metzler</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Hackam</surname><given-names>A.S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Tam</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Vaillancourt</surname><given-names>J.P.</given-names></name><name><surname>Houtzager</surname><given-names>V.</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Recruitment and activation of caspase-8 by the Huntingtin-interacting protein Hip-1 and a novel partner Hippi</article-title><source>Nat. Cell Biol</source><year>2002</year><volume>4</volume><fpage>95</fpage><lpage>105</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11788820</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="DDN033C8"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rigamonti</surname><given-names>D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Bauer</surname><given-names>J.H.</given-names></name><name><surname>De-Fraja</surname><given-names>C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Conti</surname><given-names>L.</given-names></name><name><surname>Sipione</surname><given-names>S.</given-names></name><name><surname>Sciorati</surname><given-names>C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Clementi</surname><given-names>E.</given-names></name><name><surname>Hackam</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Hayden</surname><given-names>M.R.</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>Y.</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Wild-type huntingtin protects from apoptosis upstream of caspase-3</article-title><source>J. Neurosci</source><year>2000</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>3705</fpage><lpage>3713</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10804212</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="DDN033C9"><label>9</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rigamonti</surname><given-names>D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Sipione</surname><given-nam