3</volume><fpage>239</fpage><lpage>245</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10838590</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="DDN033C14"><label>14</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hoyt</surname><given-names>K.R.</given-names></name><name><surname>Reynolds</surname><given-names>I.J.</given-names></name><name><surname>Hastings</surname><given-names>T.G.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mechanisms of dopamine-induced cell death in cultured rat forebrain neurons: interactions with and differences from glutamate-induced cell death</article-title><source>Exp. Neurol</source><year>1997</year><volume>143</volume><fpage>269</fpage><lpage>281</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9056389</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="DDN033C15"><label>15</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>McLaughlin</surname><given-names>B.A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Nelson</surname><given-names>D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Erecinska</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Chesselet</surname><given-names>M.F.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Toxicity of dopamine to striatal neurons in vitro and potentiation of cell death by a mitochondrial inhibitor</article-title><source>J. Neurochem</source><year>1998</year><volume>70</volume><fpage>2406</fpage><lpage>2415</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9603205</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="DDN033C16"><label>16</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cyr</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Beaulieu</surname><given-names>J.M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Laakso</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Sotnikova</surname><given-names>T.D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Yao</surname><given-names>W.D.</given-names></name><name><surname>Bohn</surname><given-names>L.M.</given-nam